msgctxt "#32120"
msgid "Default is a collapsible left Liquid Glass sidebar. Turning this on switches to a centered top glass capsule and reloads the skin."
msgstr "默认为左侧可收起液态玻璃侧栏，浏览内容时收起为左上角胶囊。开启后改为顶部居中的玻璃胶囊导航；切换后界面会重新载入。"

msgctxt "#32121"
msgid "Classic matte finish by default. Turning on explains real-time refraction vs static glass material for this host. Turning off restores classic immediately."
msgstr "默认使用经典外观。开启时会说明本机支持实时折射，还是仅支持玻璃材质。关闭后立即恢复经典外观。"

msgctxt "#32122"
msgid "Reorder or show/hide the 8 Home rails. Saved in current profile skin settings without rewriting skin XML; recovery actions stay reachable if all rails are hidden."
msgstr "自定义首页各栏目的显示、隐藏与上下顺序。设置保存在当前皮肤配置中，不修改安装目录文件；全部隐藏时仍保留恢复入口。"

msgctxt "#32123"
msgid "Add, hide, or reorder navigation spaces across both SideNav and TopNav. Home stays fixed first, and Tools & Power remains reachable even if all optional spaces are hidden."
msgstr "自定义左侧栏与顶栏的空间增减与顺序。首页固定在第一位；即使隐藏全部可选空间，工具与电源仍始终可达。"

msgctxt "#32124"
msgid "Inspect live GUI resolution, HDMI output mode, Skin Zoom, and TV Just Scan overscan guidance without automatically modifying calibration."
msgstr "查看当前界面分辨率、HDMI 输出、缩放与电视「点对点 / Just Scan」过扫描排查说明，不自动改动系统校准。"

msgctxt "#32125"
msgid "Disable focus zoom, panel slide-in, and page fade transitions while keeping focus capsules and active state badges intact."
msgstr "关闭焦点放大、面板滑入和页面淡入。焦点胶囊、已选状态标记和正在播放标记保持不变。"

msgctxt "#32126"
msgid "Hide OSD after 5 seconds of inactivity during playback; stays open while subtitle, audio, or settings sheets are visible."
msgstr "播放时控制栏5秒无操作后自动收起；字幕、音轨面板和设置打开时不会收起。"

msgctxt "#32127"
msgid "Automatically apply VS10 to SDR conversion for HDR, HLG, and Dolby Vision media when connected to an SDR display."
msgstr "电视不支持 HDR 时，自动对 HDR、HLG 和杜比视界片源执行 VS10 → SDR 转换。"

msgctxt "#32128"
msgid "Applies only to remotes mapped to the confirm-stop bridge. On Yatse and standard keymaps, Back dismisses the OSD while Stop ends playback."
msgstr "仅对配置了“返回确认”键位的遥控器生效。Yatse 与默认键位下，返回键只收起控制栏，停止请用控制栏上的停止键。"

